### Part C - test the five CRUD operations
### (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request" above each block,
###  or copy the same method/URL/body into Postman)

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses

### 1. READ ALL - expect 200 with SE201 and CS101
GET {{base}}

### 2. READ ONE - expect 200
GET {{base}}/1

### 3. CREATE - expect 201 with a Location header
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SE411",
  "name": "Web Engineering",
  "description": "Spring Boot web APIs",
  "credits": 3
}

### 4. UPDATE - expect 204
PUT {{base}}/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SE411",
  "name": "Advanced Web Engineering",
  "description": "Spring Boot + MySQL",
  "credits": 4
}

### 5. DELETE - expect 204 (then GET {{base}}/3 should give 404)
DELETE {{base}}/3

### Validation check - expect 400 (credits out of range)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "X1",
  "name": "Bad course",
  "credits": 20
}
